    lab given: all comments in the form of /* ... */
    our code : all comments in the form of // ...


lunix-ldisc.c:
    lunix_ldisc_open:
        flow control

        tty->flow = {.lock, .stopped, .tco_stopped}
        where lock is a spinlock_t

    lunix_ldisc_close:
        wake all sleeping processes

        tty->{write, read, breal}_wait are all wait_queue_head_t
        call wake_up_interruptible()?
    


